  "comparison": {
    "reason": "Current T05 sources reject duplicate public snapshot batches atomically and distinguish technical identity-read failures from confirmed permission loss. Participant and admin preserve protected pending state/draft during temporary 429/503 UNKNOWN, validate current identity before recovery and clear only obsolete technical messages. The parent admin guard retains a hidden/inert component on temporary failure and destroys private content on actual role/actor/epoch loss. Admin layout and exact-byte Git attributes are now controlling inputs. Max2 domain semantics remain unchanged. Full frozen-source functional evidence is bound; remaining realtime pages, operations, workload, matrix and stale impact assessments remain open. Reopen DRAFT for eventual combined review; no automatic approval or impact completion.",
